{
    "background_story": "Calliope was a self-made socialite who rose to prominence through her cunning and ambition. Born into a humble family, she always dreamed of rubbing shoulders with the elite. With a keen eye for fashion and a quick wit, she began to build a reputation as a style influencer, leveraging social media to her advantage. Before long, she was hobnobbing with the city's upper crust, attending exclusive events, and flaunting her designer wardrobe. Calliope's rapid ascent was not without controversy, however. Some whispered that she was a parvenu, a newcomer who had bought her way into high society rather than earning her place through genuine connections or accomplishments. Nevertheless, Calliope's confidence and charm won over many, and she became a fixture on the city's social scene, always pushing the boundaries of what it means to be a true member of the elite.",
